imp (0.10.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the code generator: conditions of several relations, a computed GO TO
    with a constant or an out-of-range selector, DATA of the name of a
    variable, a GO TO into another subroutine, and the registers of EXECUTE.
  * Keep the temporary files of an installed compiler in TMPDIR, else /tmp,
    and bound every string operation.
  * Install the runtime library that imp itself builds.

 -- David Walther <tederific@gmail.com>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:44:21 -0700

